   "updated": 1763000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trust boundaries: the tenant endpoint's answers are data and go to the judge only as text to grade. The judge sees answers and rules, so host it where that data may go.\nThe rules file is tenant input, loaded with a safe YAML loader. The judge key is read from the environment on the worker.",
   "originalText": "Trust boundaries: the tenant endpoint's answers are data and go to the judge only as text to grade. The judge sees answers and rules, so host it where that data may go.\nThe rules file is tenant input, loaded with a safe YAML loader. The judge key is read from the environment on the worker.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
